# Paper folder on the experiment server

Work under `Chinese_skill_benchmark_Paper/` only for this paper.

New manuscripts go in `pdf/`. After a PDF arrives, extract claims into `notes/confirmed-results.md` and copy the same numbers into `overleaf_cursor_bundle/.cursor/skills/cnss-overleaf/confirmed-results.md`.

Do not edit `access_paper/`. Do not invent F1. Experiment changes stay in the parent repo and only when the user asks.
